      "source": "https://ctvisit.com/listings/town-voluntown"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Lieutenant Thomas Leffingwell, a founder, surveyed Voluntown’s original layout after securing colonial legislature approval.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
